{"id":"f0c9e30e2bea53f4","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion.md","title":"GL框架的最小Veltman扩张","display":"df-minimal-veltman-expansion — GL框架的最小Veltman扩张","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion","aliases":["72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion"],"display":"df-minimal-veltman-expansion — GL框架的最小Veltman扩张","depends_on":["[[72-df-veltman-frame]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Definitions13.3–13.5; local canonical frame expansion","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimal-veltman-expansion — GL框架的最小Veltman扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5eb3411eede37b39\" href=\"?note=5eb3411eede37b39\" title=\"72-df-veltman-frame\">72-df-veltman-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Definitions13.3–13.5; local canonical frame expansion"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_R\">\\(S_R\\)</span> 是以 W 为域的关系族。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_R(w):=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R[w]^2:u=v\\lor R(u,v)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_R(w):=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R[w]^2:u=v\\lor R(u,v)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R传递使恒等与R的并在每个后继域上反身传递，且包含所需 R 边。若 uS_R(w)v 且 vRz，则 u=v 时直接得 uRz，uRv 时用传递性。因此这实际给出 ILM 框架，不只是 IL 框架；不涉及任何算术理论的可解释性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-veltman-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5eb3411eede37b39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-veltman-frame]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"S_R","display":false},{"tex":"S_R(w):=\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R[w]^2:u=v\\lor R(u,v)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S_R).","display":true}],"bytes":1229,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-moda